    "b-typo-book-intro": {
      "id": "b-typo-book-intro",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The stock reading metrics adapt the layout of "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Building a Second Brain",
          "attributes": {
            "italic": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " by Tiago Forte. The book's face, EB Garamond, was tried as a serif body and replaced with System Sans because the owner preferred the sans body. The owner also chose a slightly smaller size with more open leading, 18px at 1.45 instead of the book's 20px at 1.3. Both give a line pitch of about 26px, so the vertical rhythm matches the book. The book values come from body pages of the calibre-made US Letter PDF, 612 by 792pt. The measure is the line length, and the leading is the distance between baselines."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-typo-book-table": {
      "id": "b-typo-book-table",
      "type": "structured-table",
      "props": {
        "columns": [
          "Metric",
          "Book",
          "Workbench"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "Body face",
            "EB Garamond",
            "System Sans, SF Pro on macOS"
          ],
          [
            "Font size",
            "15pt (20px)",
            [
              {
                "insert": "18px",
                "attributes": {
                  "code": true
                }
              }
            ]
          ],
          [
            "Leading",
            "19.5pt (26px), a 1.3 ratio",
            [
              {
                "insert": "1.45",
                "attributes": {
                  "code": true
                }
              },
              {
                "insert": " (about 26px)"
              }
            ]
          ],
          [
            "Measure",
            "About 80 characters (79 to 82 on full lines), 468pt (624px) wide inside 1in margins",
            [
              {
                "insert": "60ch",
                "attributes": {
                  "code": true
                }
              },
              {
                "insert": " (about 650px), about 84 characters"
              }
            ]
          ],
          [
            "Headings",
            "Roboto Medium, about 17pt (23px)",
            "System Sans"
          ],
          [
            "Paragraph spacing",
            "None",
            "Not matched: 0.75rem above and below"
          ],
          [
            "First-line indent",
            "18pt (1.2em)",
            "Not matched: none"
          ],
          [
            "Alignment",
            "Justified",
            "Not matched: left-aligned"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "children": []
    },
    "b-typo-book-measure": {
      "id": "b-typo-book-measure",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "CoreText measures SF Pro, the System Sans face on macOS, at 18px with a "
        },
        {
          "insert": "0",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " glyph of about 10.84px and an average of about 7.77px per character of the book's text. A "
        },
        {
          "insert": "60ch",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " lane is therefore about 650px wide and holds about 84 characters. The lane is set in "
        },
        {
          "insert": "ch",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", so its width scales with the font size and the character count stays the same. That line runs slightly longer than the book's line of about 80 characters. The owner kept "
        },
        {
          "insert": "60ch",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " because the sizing reads well. The content width control ranges from "
        },
        {
          "insert": "40ch",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " to "
        },
        {
          "insert": "140ch",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-typo-book-limit": {
      "id": "b-typo-book-limit",
      "type": "callout",
      "props": {
        "kind": "Limitation",
        "title": "Paragraph metrics are hard-coded",
        "tone": "warning"
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Paragraph spacing, first-line indent, and alignment are not theme settings. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "PARAGRAPH_CLASSES",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true,
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "packages/docs-viewer/src/render/block-classes.ts",
              "symbol": "PARAGRAPH_CLASSES"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " applies "
        },
        {
          "insert": "my-3",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " to every paragraph, so paragraphs keep 0.75rem above and below and stay left-aligned."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
